==English==
===Etymology===
Normalized to lower case from {{term|RuBisCO}}, a semi-[[acronym]] of its full name ''[[ribulose]]-1,5-[[bisphosphate]] [[carboxylase]] [[oxygenase]]''.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}
# {{context|biochemistry|lang=en}} a [[plant]] [[enzyme]] which [[catalyze]]s both the [[fixing]] of [[atmospheric]] [[carbon dioxide]] during [[photosynthesis]] and the [[reverse]] process of [[photorespiration]]